// Stands in for the WAHA webhook so the workflow runs with one click.
// Swap this node for a Webhook trigger in production and nothing
// downstream changes: the shape it emits is { id, text }.
// Inlined rather than read from disk because the Code node sandbox
// has no fs and no process.
